      "question": "s1 = \"H1\", s2 = \"HELLO\", s3 = \"BYE\". How can we concatenate the three strings?",
      "options": {
        "A": "strcat(s1, s2, s3)",
        "B": "strcat(s1, strcat(s2, s3))",
        "C": "strcpy(s1, s2, s3)",
        "D": "strcpy(s1, strcpy(s2, s3))"
      },
      "correct": "B",
      "explanation": "strcat takes exactly two arguments, so three strings are joined by nesting: strcat(s2, s3) appends s3 to s2, then strcat(s1, ...) appends the result to s1.",
      "topicQuality": "specific"
    },
